  "prompt": "# Core Summary\nA high-intensity Chinese mini-drama scene unfolds on a rain-drenched street at night, featuring a desperate confrontation between a CEO and his lover. The clip follows a three-beat emotional arc: a violent separation attempt, a desperate revelation of truth, and a collapsing embrace. Structured into 3 dynamic shots matching the user's script, the visual language employs rapid camera movement, extreme close-ups, and dramatic lighting to maximize angst and romantic tension within 15 seconds.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:05] Urban street at night, heavy rain pouring down. Pavement reflects neon signs and streetlights in slick, oily patterns. Background is soft-focus bokeh of city traffic and blurred building lights, creating a cool blue and teal atmospheric base. Raindrops are visible as streaks against the dark background.\n[shot2][00:05-00:10] Same urban street environment, tighter framing. Background lights are more blurred due to shallow depth of field, emphasizing the subjects. Rain continues to fall heavily, catching rim light on hair and shoulders.\n[shot3][00:10-00:15] Same location, camera rotates around the subjects. Background becomes a swirling vortex of light and rain due to motion blur. Lighting shifts to highlight the intimacy of the embrace against the chaotic weather.\n\n# Subjects Description\n<ID_A> (Male Lead)\n- Gender: Male\n- Race/Ethnicity: East Asian\n- Age: Young adult (late 20s)\n- Appearance features: Handsome, sharp jawline, black trench coat soaked in rain, black hair wet and slicked back but messy strands falling over forehead. Eyes are visibly red-rimmed and bloodshot.\n- Vocal Characteristics: Deep, husky baritone, strained and shouting with emotional urgency, slight breathlessness.\n\n<ID_B> (Female Lead)\n- Gender: Female\n- Race/Ethnicity: East Asian\n- Age: Young adult (early 20s)\n- Appearance features: Delicate features, long dark hair wet and clinging to face and neck, wearing a white sleeveless dress that is translucent from rain. Face is wet with tears and rain, makeup slightly smudged.\n- Vocal Characteristics: High-pitched, clear soprano, cracking with emotion, transitioning from shouting to sobbing.\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\n<ID_B> stands with back to camera, shoulders hunched against the rain, beginning to turn away to walk left. <ID_A> lunges from the right background, hand shooting forward to grip <ID_B>'s left wrist tightly. <ID_B> whips her head around to face <ID_A>, hair flying, water droplets spraying from the movement. Camera snap-zooms from a medium shot to a close-up on their faces as they lock eyes. <ID_B>'s expression is a mix of anguish and anger, tears mixing with rain on her cheeks.\n<ID_B> (desperate, crying) shouts: [00:02-00:04]「放手！我们结束了！」\nSound of heavy rain and a sharp fabric rustle as the grab happens.\n\n[shot2][00:05-00:10]\n<ID_A> maintains his grip on <ID_B>'s wrist, pulling her slightly closer. He uses his right hand to fumble inside his coat, pulling out a small velvet ring box and snapping it open to reveal a diamond ring. He thrusts the ring toward <ID_B>'s eye level, his hand trembling visibly. Camera pushes in rapidly on <ID_A>'s face, capturing water dripping from his nose and his intense, red-rimmed eyes.\n<ID_A> (hoarse, shouting) shouts: [00:06-00:09]「你看清楚！我从来没有骗过你！」\nSound of rain intensifies, overlaying the strain in his voice.\n\n[shot3][00:10-00:15]\nExtreme close-up on <ID_B>'s eyes widening in shock, pupils contracting as she sees the ring. Her hand flies up to cover her mouth, fingers trembling. <ID_A> drops the hand holding the box and suddenly pulls <ID_B> forward, wrapping both arms around her in a crushing embrace. <ID_B> collapses against his chest, burying her face in his wet coat. Camera executes a fast 180-degree arc around the hugging couple, blurring the background lights into streaks.\n<ID_B> (muffled, sobbing) whispers: [00:12-00:15]「呜……」\nSound of fabric friction and a heavy sigh mixed with rain noise.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\n- **Visual Style**: Chinese Mini-Drama (短剧) aesthetic. High-contrast, glossy, emotionally charged.\n- **Color Palette**: Cool teal and blue tones for the rain and night environment, contrasting with warm, soft key lighting on the actors' skin to highlight emotions. Black coat and white dress create strong value contrast.\n- **Lighting**: Dramatic rim lighting to separate subjects from the dark background. Wet skin textures catch specular highlights. Bokeh background lights add depth.\n- **Texture**: High definition on water droplets, wet hair, and fabric texture. \"Beauty filter\" softness on skin but sharp details on eyes and rain.\n- **Quality**: Cinematic depth of field, motion blur on fast movements, no resolution tags.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\n- **Atmosphere**: Intense, suffocating, romantic, tragic. The heavy rain amplifies the feeling of isolation and desperation.\n- **Emotion**: High angst. The progression moves from rejection and anger to shock and finally to relieved, overwhelming sorrow. The audience should feel the weight of the misunderstanding clearing in the final second.",
